OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine day today with lighter
OL,6,Fwinds and plenty of sunny spells. The
OL,7,Fsunshine may turn hazy at times, but
OL,8,Fstaying bright and feeling warm in the
OL,9,Fsunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FStaying dry with clear spells
OL,12,Ftonight. Turning chilly under the
OL,13,Fstarry skies, with a few mist patches
OL,14,Fforming in the early hours.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FAny mist patches will quickly
OL,17,Fclear on Monday morning to leave a
OL,18,Ffine day with plenty of warm sunny
OL,19,Fspells and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
